    <readme text="=========================&#10;README&#10;=========================&#10;Here we work with video, image using CLI external tools to manipualte those media.&#10;We design &amp; create interactive &amp; easy to modify &amp; personnalize workflows.&#10;The target is to process video movies, this is the place where we create &amp; innovate around new thechnologies applied to video post production &amp; mastering management.&#10;&#10;Each lab version highlight a new innovative step in the videography Caméléon pattern field.&#10;&#10;This lab is maintain by Olivier Cugnon de Sévricourt, engineer &amp; one of the two Caméléon inventors.&#10;&#10;Olivier Cugnon de Sévricourt &amp; Vincent Tariel had designed &amp; created Caméléon.&#10;&#10;We create python CLI tools to generate videography functional patterns from external command line tools.&#10;"/>
